    "qeet": {
      "$description": "Qeet — the brand (\"Ember\") ramp, owned by Qeet rather than borrowed from a framework palette. 500 is the official Qeet orange, #F26D0E exactly (oklch(0.686 0.1855 47.1629) round-trips to it); the other steps share the lightness ladder of the status ramps, with hue drifting warmer-yellow when light and redder when deep. 550 exists for the primary-action hover, which must stay ≥4.5:1 against the dark on-brand label. Orange has meaning: primary actions, selection, focus and key brand moments — never decoration.",
